  "description": "Instruction file of the Intrag · DCE · Option page. Up to the Intrag ID column the grid matches the Intrag · Option page; from there on the columns are the ones of the ITAU FX Option bob-report extract (ITAUDataExtract_FXO/ITAUDataExtractor_FXOption), imported with the reference date in the report path. One line per trade, ';'-delimited, 28 columns, no header.",
  "file_name_rule": "Intrag-DCE-Option-AAAAMMDD.txt, written by the Send button of the Intrag · DCE · Option page into I:\\Confirmation\\Derivativos\\OTC Tracker\\Intrag\\AAAA\\mm. Mmmm\\dd (the same folder and naming logic as the other Intrag pages); an existing name gets a \" (n)\" copy suffix.",
  "notes": "The rows are born from the bob-report Import (address registered in /mapping › API/Bob Reports Links, usage 'Intrag DCE'; the date lives in the PATH as AAAA-MM-DD). From there the cycle is the same as the sister Intrag pages: edit (Pending, maker) → approve (Approved, maker ≠ checker) → Mapping Intrag ID (return CSV → Success) → Send (New/Approved → Sent). The generated file has NO header line: each selected row becomes one ';'-delimited line, grouped by Trade Date — one file per date.",
  "base_key": "",
  "le_pair": "",
  "variant_label": "",
  "file_name": "",
  "file_type": "delimited",
  "separator": ";",
